{"name":"Crisp Collar","hex":"#b1c8d2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"crisp","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Senses relating to curliness.\n Of hair: curling, especially in tight, stiff curls or ringlets; also , of a person: having hair curled in this manner.","Of hair: curling, especially in tight, stiff curls or ringlets; also , of a person: having hair curled in this manner."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Senses relating to something brittle.\n In full potato crisp: a thin slice of potato which has been deep-fried until it is brittle and crispy, and eaten when cool; they are typically packaged and sold as a snack.","In full potato crisp: a thin slice of potato which has been deep-fried until it is brittle and crispy, and eaten when cool; they are typically packaged and sold as a snack."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/crisp"},{"term":"collar","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Clothes that encircle the neck.\nThe part of an upper garment (shirt, jacket, etc.) that fits around the neck and throat, especially if sewn from a separate piece of fabric.\n\nA decorative band or other fabric around the neckline.\nA chain worn around the neck.\nA similar detachable item.\nA coloured ring round the neck of a bird or mammal.\nA band or chain around an animal's neck, used to restrain and/or identify it.","The part of an upper garment (shirt, jacket, etc.) that fits around the neck and throat, especially if sewn from a separate piece of fabric."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To grab or seize by the collar or neck.","To place a collar on, to fit with one."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/collar"}],"entries":[],"images":[],"sounds":{"crisp":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/67/En-us-crisp.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wik